    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know it sounds scary but he's been through a nasty flu before and always gets super loopy when he's hot. he's normally a very sharp guy, he's just responding a bit slow today. if i just give him a higher dose of ibuprofen/tylenol to bring the fever down, wouldn't that solve the issue? i really don't want to sit in an ER for 8 hours if it's just a lingering virus.",
